Sītā sees adorned Rāvaṇa and trembles covering limbs and weeping --- Rāvaṇa sees wretched Sītā on bare ground like sinking boat --- Similes paint her eclipsed fallen dried yet mind fixed on Rāma --- Fast-worn single-braided Sītā prays palms joined for Rāvaṇa defeat --- Rāvaṇa tempts weeping Rāma-devoted Sītā toward ruin
